<view class="guide-page">
  <view class="guide-hero">
    <view class="guide-kicker">SINGAPORE SCHOOL GUIDE</view>
    <view class="guide-title">从家庭条件出发，做一份能执行的选校方案。</view>
    <view class="guide-subtitle">查学校、比课程与费用，再把关注学校放进自己的申请计划。</view>
    <view class="guide-action-row">
      <button class="guide-action" bindtap="goAssessment">开始智能选校</button>
      <button class="guide-action secondary" bindtap="goSchools">找学校</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <view class="guide-section-title">你现在要做什么</view>
    <view class="guide-section-note">从实际任务开始，不必先读完整本指南。</view>
    <view class="guide-task-list">
      <view class="guide-task" bindtap="goSchools"><text>01</text><view><b>我想快速找学校</b><small>按体系、梯队和预算查看</small></view><i>›</i></view>
      <view class="guide-task" bindtap="goAssessment"><text>02</text><view><b>我不知道该选哪些学校</b><small>生成有依据的候选清单</small></view><i>›</i></view>
      <view class="guide-task" bindtap="goCases"><text>03</text><view><b>我想看相似家庭怎么选</b><small>只展示授权、匿名、审核案例</small></view><i>›</i></view>
      <view class="guide-task" bindtap="goPlan"><text>04</text><view><b>继续整理我的方案</b><small>已加入 {{planCount}} 所学校</small></view><i>›</i></view>
      <view class="guide-task" bindtap="goConsult"><text>05</text><view><b>情况复杂，需要人工判断</b><small>由赵宏伟统一跟进</small></view><i>›</i></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <view class="guide-section-title">常被比较的学校</view>
    <view class="guide-section-note">第一梯队是编辑分类，不是官方排名。</view>
    <view class="guide-list">
      <view class="guide-row" wx:for="{{popularSchools}}" wx:key="slug" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="openSchool">
        <view class="guide-row-main"><view class="guide-row-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="guide-row-note">{{item.comparison.curriculum}}</view></view><view class="guide-arrow">›</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="guide-notice">资格、日期、费用和学额会变化。申请前必须再次打开官方页面核对。</view>
</view>
<guide-nav active="home" />
